      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Medical (Amendment) Bill 1992"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Medical (Amendment) Act 1992."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_1__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding the amendments in paragraph (b) of section 3 and paragraphs (a), (c), (f) and (g) of section 4, the provisions of paragraph (b) of subsection (1) of section 12 and the provisions of subsections (1), (3), (7) and (8) of section 13 of the principal Act shall continue to apply to a person who, immediately before the coming into force of this Act—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "holds a qualification referred to in subparagraph (ii) of paragraph (a) of subsection (1) of the said section 12 and has made an application to sit or resit for the examination prescribed under paragraph (aa) of subsection (1) of that section; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "is undergoing a period of service in a medical capacity under subsection (3) of section 13, as if the amendments made to the said provisions in sections 12 and 13 had not been made. MEDICAL (AMENDMENT)"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_10__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding the amendments in paragraphs (b), (d), (e) and (h) of section 4, the provisions of subsections (2), (4), (5) and (9) of section 13 of the principal Act shall continue to apply to a person who, immediately before the coming into force of this Act, has been engaged in employment in a resident medical capacity under subsection (2) of the said section 13 as if the amendments made to the said provisions in section 13 had not been made."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Part VII. Part VII the following Part VII:"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_2__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_17"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 3 of the Medical Act 1971, which in this Act"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "is referred to as the \"principal Act\", is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_2__para_a__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_2__para_a__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (13)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_2__para_a__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting the word \"or\" at the end of paragraph (a)"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_2__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the full stop at the end of paragraph (b) the word \"; or\", and by inserting immediately after paragraph (b) the following new paragraph (c): \"(c) if his name has at any time been struck off from the Register.\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting immediately after subsection (13) the following new subsection (13A): \"(13A) A practitioner whose name has been suspended from the Register, or who has been reprimanded under section 30 shall BILL not be eligible to be nominated and appointed or elected or appointed, as the case may be, under the provisions of any of the paragraphs (b) to (g) of subsection (1)— (a) in the case of a suspension, for a period of six years after the expiration of such suspension; or (b) in the case of a reprimand, for a period of six years from the date of such reprimand.\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting immediately after subsection (14) the following new subsections (15), (16) and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_17",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ": \"(15) (a) Where the Council in the exercise of its disciplinary jurisdiction under the Act— (i) appoints a committee to conduct a preliminary investigation; or (ii) holds a disciplinary inquiry, in respect of any practitioner who is a member of the Council, such practitioner shall be suspended. Such suspension shall in the case of a preliminary investigation take effect from the date of commencement of the investigation, or in the case of a disciplinary inquiry, with effect from the date of institution of the inquiry. (b) Where at the conclusion of a preliminary investigation the Council determines that a disciplinary inquiry should be held the period of suspension of a member shall continue until the conclusion of the disciplinary inquiry. (16) Any member of the Council who has been suspended under paragraph (a) or (b) of subsection (15) shall forthwith be reinstated MEDICAL (AMENDMENT) as such member if at the conclusion of the preliminary investigation or the disciplinary inquiry, as the case may be, the Council finds that no case has been made out in respect of the member. (17) Any member of the Council who is to be reinstated pursuant to subsection (16) shall, if the reinstatement is to take effect before the expiration of his term of office, be reinstated to hold office for the unexpired portion of his term of office.\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/41/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
